Package: ADaMViz.SubmissionSync
Title: From Clinical Questions to Review-Ready Figures and Reproducible R
    Code
Version: 0.1.0.9013
Authors@R:
    person("Ramnath", "Dhadage", , "ram.dhadage123@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates and conversationally refines ggplot2 visualizations
    from Analysis Data Model (ADaM) datasets and other permitted tabular
    data. Executes generated R code in a controlled environment and
    records input metadata, code, package versions, outputs, and review
    status to support reproducibility, traceability, and validation of
    clinical reporting workflows.
